WEBVTT

00:42:57.548 --> 00:43:01.169
so a very individualistic ethos
was replaced by a communitarian ethos.

00:43:01.193 --> 00:43:03.458
Second, you had a civic renaissance.

00:43:03.482 --> 00:43:05.824
You saw the creation
of the Boys and Girls Clubs,

00:43:05.848 --> 00:43:07.054
the Boy and Girl Scouts,

00:43:07.078 --> 00:43:09.650
the temperance movement,
the settlement house movement,

00:43:09.674 --> 00:43:11.502
NAACP, unions, environmental movement.

00:43:11.526 --> 00:43:13.877
And then, later, you had
the progressive movement,

00:43:13.901 --> 00:43:15.073
a political movement.

00:43:15.097 --> 00:43:18.216
So, it went: cultural change,
civic change, political change.

00:43:18.240 --> 00:43:20.394
And to me, that's probably
the right sequence.

00:43:20.418 --> 00:43:22.527
I think we're in a cultural change moment.

00:43:22.551 --> 00:43:24.434
We're certainly in a civic renaissance.

00:43:24.458 --> 00:43:27.813
So many people are starting new
organizations to weave people together.

00:43:27.837 --> 00:43:31.831
The political change ... I live near
Capitol Hill, and that I don't see yet.